      "id": "claim_a4dcdaf95370421a8b719fc53c04fea8",
      "statement": "InfraTicket publishes its application on host port 8000 and PostgreSQL on host port 5432, while InfraData intentionally publishes its TimescaleDB/PostgreSQL container on host port 5433 so both database services can run concurrently.",
